(text "Rockchip tablet reference pp14/16/17/19/20; HW Guide V1.2 sections 2.2.2.8 / 2.2.2.16 / 2.2.2.17.\nPlace each 100nF under U1 near its ball; C531 (VCCIO6 bulk) close to U1. External IO current budgets remain open.\nVCCIO2 needs a physical HIGH strap; DTS does not set its voltage mode. IO3 must track the SD regulator voltage." (at 15.24 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ec042f27-cb45-5f6a-9931-23891deb4981"))
